oXygen for the WebCLAP port, all under OXYGEN_WEBCLAP:
- upstream's module editors are left out (the port has its own, they are not fetched)
- the dynamic EQ, the multiband compressor and the maximizer report their gain reduction for the port's meters
  (the multiband compressor keeps the most of each block)
- the maximizer's soft ceiling stage runs once more at the host rate, after downsampling: the downsampling filter
  rebuilds peaks above the ceiling past about 10 dB of limiting

